  "summary": "Key Takeaways We believe hair behavior is a result of biology, structure, and environment. Every Function of Beauty formula is personalized to your unique hair needs. Different hair types require different support for moisture, strength, and styling. We focus on understanding the causes of hair behavior, not just treating symptoms. Personalized hair care starts with understanding how your hair functions. More",
